 And agents can fix most of them, many of them.

194
00:21:04,620 --> 00:21:06,020
 Some of them require product decisions.

195
00:21:06,140 --> 00:21:08,100
 So, like, that can't be automated.

196
00:21:09,980 --> 00:21:11,360
 So, I mean, that's a challenge.

197
